  "metadata": {
    "name": "quay",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Quay Markets — Solana DEX with per-Strategy DSL pricing curves. Pinocchio-based program with hand-rolled sBPF dispatcher; this IDL was authored by hand from onchain/program/src/ + client/sdk/src/ to mirror the on-chain wire format. Account model: GlobalConfig (singleton) + MarketMaker (per-owner asset table) + Strategy (pricing curve bound to one asset pair) + Quotes (live quote feed).",
