    {
      "name": "swap",
      "docs": [
        "Single-strategy taker swap. The taker signs the IN transfer; the MarketMaker PDA signs the OUT transfer. `side`: 0 = SELL_BASE (taker gives base, gets quote), 1 = BUY_BASE. Slippage check: out_to_taker >= min_amount_out. The Instructions sysvar is required at index 11 so the program can gather VM TxContext before token program accounts. Input-derived protocol fee: fee = amount_in * strategy.protocol_fee_bps / 10_000 (IN-token atoms) is skimmed from the input before pricing; the curve runs once on the net input (amount_in - fee) and returns amount_out directly (no price scaling). The fee accrues on the IN-side asset's protocol_fee_amount."
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "name": "global_config",
          "pda": {
            "seeds": [
